title: How to treat a 'priority reexamination'?
pid: 61bb5422-cdf6-4790-80a6-fc6e574c8f07
body: |2-
  "If ... law enforcement ... a Notice of Priority Reexamination of Driver with a check mark in the top box ... *five working days* to contact DMV to initiate the process or your driving privilege will be automatically suspended."
